%%% note
中置の呼び出しで、関数の型の引数に関数の値 (関数を返す呼び出し・関数の名前) を渡しても、実 DW は ($, $$, $$$) -> 右辺 と包む。
呼ぶと関数そのものが返る (dw::test の x must beObject() が matcher を 2 回呼ぶのはこのため)。前置の呼び出しは包まない。
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
fun ap(x, f: (Number) -> Any) = f(x)
fun aps(x, fs: Array<(Number) -> Any>) = fs map $(x)
fun mk() = (y) -> y * 10
var g = (y) -> y + 1
---
{
  call: typeOf(1 ap mk()) as String,
  ref: typeOf(1 ap g) as String,
  twice: (1 ap mk())(2),
  arr: (1 aps [mk(), g, $ + 100]) map (typeOf($) as String),
  prefix: ap(1, mk())
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "call": "Function",
  "ref": "Function",
  "twice": 20,
  "arr": [
    "Function",
    "Function",
    "Number"
  ],
  "prefix": 10
}
